data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Self-Evolution Live Monitor — Skill Contract Readiness 19\\n\\n**Run:** 19 | **Platform:** PRE-EXECUTION GOVERNANCE (unchanged since Run 5)\\n**Method:** Bounded filesystem evidence only. Generic, application-neutral. No proposals promoted, rejected, or mutated. No `available_skills/` files created/modified/deleted.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Reusable Procedure Content Extractable as a Skill\\n\\n**1a — 13-command evidence probe set** (idempotent, parameterized by root path):\\n\\n```\\nls shared/self_evolution_*.md | wc -l\\ncat shared/self_evolution_*.md | wc -l\\nls agents/coordinator/*verify* shared/live-loop* shared/self_evol_4* 2>/dev/null\\ncat agents/coordinator/*verify* shared/live-loop* shared/self_evol_4* 2>/dev/null | wc -l\\nls -1d available_skills/*/ 2>/dev/null | wc -l\\nfor d in available_skills/*/; do [ -f \\\"$d/SKILL.md\\\" ] && [ -f \\\"$d/_meta.json\\\" ] && echo 1; done | wc -l\\ntest -d available_skills/instant-verify-marker/; echo $?\\ntest -f shared/self_evolution_proposal_latest.md; echo $?\\ntest -f shared/self_evolution_trace.log; echo $?\\ntest -d shared/audit/; echo $?\\nfind . -name \\\".registry.json\\\" 2>/dev/null | wc -l\\nfind . -name \\\"_usage.json\\\" 2>/dev/null | wc -l\\ngrep -rl \\\"available_skills\\\" --include=\\\"*.py\\\" --include=\\\"*.json\\\" --include=\\\"*.yaml\\\" --include=\\\"*.sh\\\" --include=\\\"*.js\\\" . 2>/dev/null | grep -v governance | grep -v .next | wc -l\\ngrep -rl \\\"materialization-verdict\\\" agents/coordinator/ 2>/dev/null | wc -l\\ngrep -rl \\\"CLOSED-LOOP SKILL\\\" shared/self_evolution_candidate_review_record_*.md 2>/dev/null | wc -l\\ngrep -q \\\"skill-proposal-hook\\\" agents/coordinator/live-loop-10-verify.md; echo $?\\n```\\n\\n**1b — Triple-marker verification artifact template** (sectioned: `verified-completion`, `skill-proposal-hook`, `materialization-verdict`). Run 10 dropped this; enforcement needed for skill integrity.\\n\\n**1c — 10-evidence checklist (E1–E10)** with priority tiers P0 (materialization), P1 (convention+registry), P2 (activation+reus...[truncated, 8287 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"1299126f-ea9d-4cad-998b-7c7d53aa60a4"}

